      "heading": "B - Audience, Section Three Testing",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B - Audience, Section Three Testing\n\nThe audience is first-time never-licensed applicants preparing for the regular noncommercial Class C written knowledge test in California, reading at a plain-English level. Section Three teaches the testing process only; it assumes no prior driving knowledge and carries no prerequisites beyond literacy. Content progresses from the three license tests and their attempt rules to test-day vehicle checks and drive-test conduct.\n",
